#: ../../../contributing.rst:207
msgid "Building Documentation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../contributing.rst:209
msgid ""
"`Sphinx <https://www.sphinx-doc.org>`_ builds the documentation from the "
"``docs`` directory; edit the pages there. Build the HTML documentation with:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../contributing.rst:212
msgid "$ tox run -e docs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../contributing.rst:216
msgid ""
"This runs ``sphinx-build`` with ``-W --keep-going``, so any warning fails "
